      "learningTitle": "Using Adverbs of Manner and Frequency",
      "learningPoints": [
        "Put frequency adverbs such as always, usually and often before most main verbs.",
        "Put frequency adverbs after the verb 'to be'.",
        "Use adverbs of manner to describe how an action is performed.",
        "Many manner adverbs are formed with adjective + -ly.",
        "Recognise irregular forms such as good → well.",
        "Place manner adverbs naturally in simple sentences."
